Guha returns home after Rāma crosses --- Sumantra reaches silent joyless Ayōdhyā --- Citizens crowd asking where is Rāma --- Sumantra says Rāma sent him back at Gaṅgā --- People and window women wail for Rāma --- Sumantra crosses courts and delivers Rāma message --- Daśaratha faints hearing Rāma message --- Kausalyā rebukes silent king --- Kausalyā falls and women wail --- City joins lament again